Refresh the CIX PL011 patch for Linux 6.18.52 without reverting the
stable kernel's console clock fix. Keep console setup/exit and system
suspend/resume clock ownership, including resume failure cleanup. Do not
reintroduce per-write clock operations in the CIX legacy console callback.
Save CIX registers before disabling the console clock and restore them
after re-enabling it. Retain the remaining CIX changes.

